OL,6,FThe superpower battle over energy ` and
OL,7,Fwhat it means for your bills
OL,9,FA gas rig in the North Sea. An oil
OL,10,Ffield in Texas. A solar panel factory
OL,11,Fin China. They can feel a world away,
OL,12,Fbut your energy bill says otherwise.
OL,14,FIn January, it could jump by more than
OL,15,Fa quarter ` around #460 extra a year
OL,16,Ffor the typical UK household `
OL,17,Faccording to the latest forecasts from
OL,18,Fthe big suppliers British Gas, EDF and
OL,19,FE.ON.
